{
  "_comment": "A provider's model listing body -> the page's ids (in the provider's order) and the next page's cursor (bmlib #680). Read by tests/test_model_listing.py and rust/bmlib/tests/llm_model_listing.rs. The cloud bodies follow each provider's API reference (shapes, not live replies); the Ollama one is a real /api/tags reply with two entries kept and some fields dropped.",
